          <article class="concept-card" data-explanation-group><div class="concept-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Concept 06</p><h2>Evidence record</h2></div><div class="segmented small"><button class="segment active" data-level="simple" type="button">Simple</button><button class="segment" data-level="technical" type="button">Technical</button></div></div><div data-explanation="simple"><p>A signed package connects the question, test recipe, raw traces, checks, result, limits, and repeat attempts so anyone can see what happened.</p></div><div data-explanation="technical" hidden><p>A content-addressed artifact chain retains schema version, provenance, authority, signatures, validator outputs, uncertainty, conflicts, supersession, and review state.</p></div></article>
